|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|          2 2                      2                       2                 |
|+ .582763z )  + .889185*(- .389153x  + .18471x*y + .191413y  + .590206x*z -  |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                    2 2                    2                        2        |
|.140289y*z - .64014z )  + 1.85689*(.622038x  + .195425x*y - .441064y  +      |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                  2 2                      2                 |
