    solveSOS_lpRingElement_cmRingElement_cmMatrix_rp, -- sum-of-squares problem
    in a quotient ring
  * *note sosPoly: sosPoly, -- make an SOS polynomial
  * *note SDPResult: SDPResult, -- result of a semidefinite programming
    computation
  * *note Solver: (SemidefiniteProgramming)Solver, -- picking a semidefinite
    programming solver

