    printed
  * "optimize(...,Verbosity=>...)" -- see *note Verbosity:
    (SemidefiniteProgramming)Verbosity, -- control the level of information
    printed

Further information
===================

  * Default value: 0
  * Function: *note solveSOS: solveSOS, -- solve a sum-of-squares problem
