value(SOSPoly) -- expansion of a weighted SOS decomposition
***********************************************************

  * Function: *note value: (Macaulay2Doc)value,
  * Usage: 
        value(s)
  * Inputs:
      * s, an instance of the type *note SOSPoly: SOSPoly,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, a polynomial

Description
===========

Given an object of type *note SOSPoly: SOSPoly,, this method expands the
polynomial and computes $f = \sum_i d_i g_i^2$.

+------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y];                   |
+------------------------------------+
|i2 : s = sosPoly(R, {x+1,y}, {2,3} )|
|                                    |
|              2        2            |
|o2 = 2*(x + 1)  + 3*(y)             |
|                                    |
|o2 : SOSPoly                        |
+------------------------------------+
|i3 : value( s )                     |
|                                    |
|       2     2                      |
|o3 = 2x  + 3y  + 4x + 2             |
|                                    |
|o3 : R                              |
+------------------------------------+


